# The curator's book notes (Obsidian), read by the sync into the graph: private, and they quote
# books in copyright, so never in this public repository (32 §2.1).
GraphRevised/obsidian_book_notes/

# Harvest payloads are data, not scripts (curator, 2026-10-13): preserved Wikidata records
# fetched by the harvest stay on disk (hashed in their .metadata.json and on the graph's
# AuthorityRecords) but are not tracked. Records tracked before 2026-10-13 stay tracked.
GraphRevised/phase-5-source/wikidata-Q*
